Container link & docker compose
# https://github.com/dockersamples/example-voting-app

▪ download code from git hub
  https://github.com/dockersamples/example-voting-app
  go to vote directory and create image and run container
# docker build . -t votting-app
# docker run -p 5000:80 -d --link redis:redis votting-app

2. Run redis container
# docker run -d --name=redis redis

3. Run database
# docker run -d --name=db postgres:9.4
# docker run --name db -e POSTGRES_PASSWORD=postgres -d postgres:9.4

4. go to worker directory
# docker build . -t worker-app
# docker run --link redis:redis --link db:db worker-app

Container link & docker compose

5. go to result folder
# docker build . -t result-app
# docker run -p 5004:80 --link db:db result-app

▪ Install docker compose
